Package: xe-bug-report
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @LIBC6@, libgcc-s1
Recommends: pciutils
Suggests: xpu-smi
Maintainer: xe-bug-report contributors <savery42@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/team-blue-savery42/xe-bug-report
Description: Standalone GPU diagnostic collector
 Writes one redacted zip bundle of kernel logs, sysfs and debugfs attributes,
 PCI state, package lists and xpu-smi output, for bug reports. It does not link
 Level Zero or any GPU library, so it still runs when the GPU runtime is
 missing or the driver is wedged, and it records why a source could not be
 collected. Host and user names, serial numbers and addresses are replaced by
 default.
